<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">Uricchio's Trattoria offers a distinct selection of appetizers, soups and entrees to satisfy every taste, including fresh seasonal dishes prepared with care and quality from our Executive Chef Raphael Hernandez and his crew. &nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">We offer wines to accompany every meal, and would be happy to make a recommendation for you.</p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">And if you've saved room, treat yourself or someone special to a mouth-watering dessert, courtesy of LaMousse.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</p>
</div>




















  
  



