<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h2 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong><em>Offering Patio, in-house dining, &amp; curbside togo service</em> </strong></h2><h1 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;">Hours</h1><h3 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>LUNCH </strong></h3><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class=""><strong>Wednesday - Friday</strong></p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">11 - 2</p><h2 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>DInner</strong></h2><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class=""><strong>Tuesday - Saturday</strong></p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">bar open at 4:30</p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">dinner served at 5</p><h2 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>HAPPY HOUR</strong></h2><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class=""><strong>Wednesday - Friday</strong></p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">bar area</p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">4:30 - 6</p>
</div>




















  
  



